{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31587","headline":"送人隐居 · 李羣玉","name":"送人隐居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碁局茅亭幽涧滨，竹寒江静远无人。\n邨梅尚敛风前笑，沙草初偷雪後春。\n鹏鷃喻中消日月，沧浪歌里放心神。\n平生自有烟霞志，久欲抛身狎隐沦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}